{
  "version": "2026.11.05",
  "comment": "Curated catalog of public DNS blocklist sources, plus built-in manual templates and one-click profiles. Feed snapshot derived from AdGuard's HostlistsRegistry (https://github.com/AdguardTeam/HostlistsRegistry, GPL-3.0) plus the most-cited Pi-hole defaults and Hagezi / OISD entries; each source's own license is recorded per entry. Templates are entry sets we ship inline rather than fetch \u2014 the SafeSearch rewrites come from each provider's own documentation. Move in lockstep with releases: a stale feed URL is a failing refresh, and a stale rewrite target is a search engine that stops resolving.",
